{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Private Photo Scrubber 是一款在分享前檢查相片私隱元數據的工具，所有處理均在裝置上進行，適合注重個人私隱的 iOS 用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>檢查與清除相片元數據</h2>\n<p>透過 iOS 系統相片選擇器可一次揀選 1 至 20 張相片，檢視位置、拍攝時間、裝置、軟件、描述與版權等欄位，未分類資料亦會分開顯示。可只移除位置資料，或清除所有支援的私隱欄位，並建立新的 JPEG 副本，原始檔案不會被修改。輸出後會重新檢查，只有選定的支援欄位確實消失才會顯示 Verified。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-767-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-768-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-769-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-770-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-771-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Private Photo Scrubber</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T01:02:08.187922+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}